01:03:01.466 --> 01:03:03.466
Hallelujah. Amen.

863
01:03:03.466 --> 01:03:05.466
And amen.

864
01:03:05.466 --> 01:03:07.466
And the authority that God has given me...

865
01:03:07.466 --> 01:03:09.466
may I at this moment...

866
01:03:09.466 --> 01:03:11.466
call you man and woman.

867
01:03:11.466 --> 01:03:13.466
And I would like to ask...

868
01:03:13.466 --> 01:03:15.466
during the kiss that you are about to give each other...

869
01:03:15.466 --> 01:03:17.466
that everyone would stand up...

870
01:03:17.466 --> 01:03:19.466
and give this couple a round of applause.

871
01:03:19.466 --> 01:03:21.466
You may kiss each other.

872
01:03:37.466 --> 01:03:39.466
Oh, you need to kiss one more time...

873
01:03:39.466 --> 01:03:41.466
for the photo.

874
01:03:43.466 --> 01:03:45.466
Oh dear.

875
01:03:51.466 --> 01:03:53.466
Is it on?

876
01:03:53.466 --> 01:03:55.466
Otherwise, we'll just do it again.

877
01:03:57.466 --> 01:03:59.466
Cas and Monika.

878
01:03:59.466 --> 01:04:01.466
Today we have...

879
01:04:01.466 --> 01:04:03.466
talked about love.

880
01:04:03.466 --> 01:04:05.466
And that love was not based on my wisdom...

881
01:04:05.466 --> 01:04:07.466
of your wisdom.

882
01:04:07.466 --> 01:04:09.466
That love was based on God's Word.

883
01:04:09.466 --> 01:04:11.466
The only truth that exists.

884
01:04:11.466 --> 01:04:13.466
So I want to tell you...

885
01:04:13.466 --> 01:04:15.466
as the first wedding gift...

886
01:04:15.466 --> 01:04:17.466
the sword of God's Word.

887
01:04:17.466 --> 01:04:19.466
Namely, why do I say the sword?

888
01:04:19.466 --> 01:04:21.466
A sword, you can cut with it...

889
01:04:21.466 --> 01:04:23.466
and it distinguishes between what is good...

890
01:04:23.466 --> 01:04:25.466
and what is not good. It also distinguishes...

891
01:04:25.466 --> 01:04:27.466
between what is true and what is not true.

892
01:04:27.466 --> 01:04:29.466
And in this is everything you need...

893
01:04:29.466 --> 01:04:31.466
for your marriage and for your own life.

894
01:04:31.466 --> 01:04:33.466
So I want to congratulate you.

895
01:04:33.466 --> 01:04:35.466
Congratulations on this marriage.

896
01:04:35.466 --> 01:04:37.466
Husband of Monika.

897
01:04:37.466 --> 01:04:39.466
Congratulations on this marriage. Wife of Cas.

898
01:04:39.466 --> 01:04:41.466
And I want to give you both this Bible.

899
01:04:41.466 --> 01:04:43.466
In the name of Jesus. Amen.

900
01:04:43.466 --> 01:04:45.466
May I have another round of applause?

901
01:04:49.466 --> 01:04:51.466
Then I would like to invite my dear...

902
01:04:51.466 --> 01:04:53.466
and beautiful sister Debbie.

903
01:04:53.466 --> 01:04:55.466
She will have some announcements for us.

904
01:04:55.466 --> 01:04:57.466
And afterwards she will...

905
01:04:57.466 --> 01:04:59.466
close this wonderful service with prayer.

906
01:05:01.466 --> 01:05:03.466
What a delightful day.

907
01:05:03.466 --> 01:05:05.466
It is a beautiful weather.

908
01:05:05.466 --> 01:05:07.466
We have a lovely couple here.

909
01:05:07.466 --> 01:05:09.466
And the celebration continues.

910
01:05:11.466 --> 01:05:13.466
Soon we will sing...

911
01:05:13.466 --> 01:05:15.466
a beautiful song.

912
01:05:15.466 --> 01:05:17.466
And then listen.

913
01:05:17.466 --> 01:05:19.466
And at the end of the song, you will come with me.

914
01:05:19.466 --> 01:05:21.466
And then you may all follow us.

915
01:05:21.466 --> 01:05:23.466
And then we will go outside.

916
01:05:23.466 --> 01:05:25.466
Is it still nice to have a cup of coffee.

917
01:05:25.466 --> 01:05:27.466
And a cup of tea.

918
01:05:27.466 --> 01:05:29.466
And then we can congratulate them.

919
01:05:29.466 --> 01:05:31.466
And then we can have a nice time together.

920
01:05:31.466 --> 01:05:33.466
So that will be just fine.

921
01:05:33.466 --> 01:05:35.466
But I want to thank you for this day.

922
01:05:35.466 --> 01:05:37.466
Lord, thank you very much.

923
01:05:37.466 --> 01:05:39.466
That you are with us.

924
01:05:39.466 --> 01:05:41.466
That you have given your love to us.

925
01:05:41.466 --> 01:05:43.466
So that we can also give it back to you.

926
01:05:43.466 --> 01:05:45.466
And show it.

927
01:05:45.466 --> 01:05:47.466
But also to each other.

928
01:05:47.466 --> 01:05:49.466
Thank you that we can show that love to each other.

929
01:05:49.466 --> 01:05:51.466
In a marriage.

930
01:05:51.466 --> 01:05:53.466
But also towards our children.

931
01:05:53.466 --> 01:05:55.466
Or towards brothers and sisters.

932
01:05:55.466 --> 01:05:57.466
Towards family.

933
01:05:57.466 --> 01:05:59.466
Towards friends, family, colleagues.

934
01:05:59.466 --> 01:06:01.466
Lord, your love is the foundation of our lives.

935
01:06:01.466 --> 01:06:03.466
And Cas and Monika have made that so clear today.

936
01:06:03.466 --> 01:06:05.466
Through the texts they have chosen.

937
01:06:05.466 --> 01:06:07.466
Your love.

938
01:06:07.466 --> 01:06:09.466
They will take that with them into their marriage.

939
01:06:09.466 --> 01:06:11.466
Lord, we want to thank you for this wonderful service.

940
01:06:11.466 --> 01:06:13.466
The celebration continues.

941
01:06:13.466 --> 01:06:15.466
The weather is lovely.

942
01:06:15.466 --> 01:06:17.466
God, we are thankful to You for this day.

943
01:06:17.466 --> 01:06:19.466
Amen.

944
01:06:19.466 --> 01:06:21.466
We are going to sing one more song.

945
01:06:21.466 --> 01:06:23.466
Yes.

